   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Storage solution »e.g. storage« </h3> <h1> Automated tool dispensing </h1>",
   "body": "<p><strong>»z.Storage« reduces costs and increases transparency in the tool store. Simply scan the inventory number of a tool with a mobile device and select the required components. »z.Storage« takes over the booking in tool management and initiates the issue with a Smart Cabinet from ZOLLER.</strong></p> <p>Users can find their way around the intuitive software interface with little training. This ZOLLER solution is also easy to implement.<br/> z».Storage« continuously updates the tool bookings. Based on the booking history, you can easily create reports with transparent overviews of efficient costs and tool usage. The Zoller TMS service is available to send you these reports.</p> <p>With »z.Storage«, you can reduce costs by controlling the stock and issue of items. Standard items can be issued without additional personnel.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/company/contact\">Request now</a></p>",
